52110504_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RNgia0yTgu0Q7kNvwEU2K8k&_nc_oc=AdpH_1ExPz0aI7NFUEoN-VK1as0VMrGVUjsTmUYwOUJJDFBoOAVAdFIWaC-ukU9VACc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRs7jU0dB7pshw6vXrEapWkx23IW5okUV4NaqMTciqYMw&oe=6AFC8D0E"}, "display_name": "First Person Tennis - The Real Tennis Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "First Person Tennis is the first tennis simulator developed for VR.\n\nNow, you can play on a real tennis court and face professional tennis players. \nYou'll have to show all your technical and tactical skills.\n\nVR Controls:\nHold the controller/racket and play tennis.\n\nFeatures: \n- Arcade and Simulation mode.\n- Online Multiplayer.\n- 3 different ways to run through the court: Teleport, Run in Place, Sliding Run.\n- One handed serve.\n- 7 different court surfaces: clay, grass, hard, blue-green hard, classic synthetic, indoor hard and indoor synthetic; each with a specific rebound. \n- 13 tournaments: 4 Slam and 9 Masters. \n- Full ranking system. \n- Fully customizable 3D male player. ", "short_description": "First Person Tennis is the first tennis simulator developed for VR. Now, you can play on a real tennis court and face professional tennis players. You'll have to show all your technical and tactical skills."}]}, "developer_name": "Mikori Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fptprivacypolicy/home-page", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.facebook.com/MikoriGames/", "publisher_name": "Mikori Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/Firstpersontennis", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SIMULATION", "ACTION"], "has_in